   "daf": "41b",
   "sentenceId": 8,
   "he": "גְּמָ׳ בְּקָרוֹב לָא פְּלִיגִי דַּאֲסִיר. כִּי פְּלִיגִי בְּרִחוּק, רַבִּי מֵאִיר סָבַר: גָּזְרִינַן רָחוֹק מִשּׁוּם קָרוֹב, דְּקָא מְרַפֵּי לֵהּ לְאַרְעָא קַמֵּיהּ. וְרַבָּנַן סָבְרִי: לָא גָּזְרִינַן.",
   "en": "«GEMARA:» In a case «where» one is «proximate» to the other, the tanna’im «do not disagree that it is prohibited» for them to work together. «When they disagree,» it is in a case «where» one is «distant» from the other. «Rabbi Meir holds: We issue a decree» prohibiting their working together when one is «distant» from the other, «due to» the prohibition against their working together when one is «proximate» to the other, «as he loosens for him the earth before him. And the Rabbis hold: We do not issue a decree.»"
  }
 ],
